{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30082","headline":"送雍陶侍御赴兖州裴尚书命 · 刘得仁","name":"送雍陶侍御赴兖州裴尚书命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纶阁知孤直，翻论北巷贤。\n且縻莲幕里，会致玉堦前。\n洙泗秋微动，龟蒙月正圆。\n元戎军务息，清句待君联。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}